 "summary": "Seven glass-passivated standard-recovery rectifiers in the surface-mount SMB (DO-214AA) package, rated 5.0 A average forward current and 150 A surge. Their voltage ratings run from 50 V VRRM (S5AB) to 1000 V VRRM (S5MB). Forward voltage is at most 1.0 V at 5.0 A and reverse leakage at most 2.0 µA at 25 °C. Applications named are power-supply rectification, inverters, converters and freewheeling. S5MB is the 1000 V part.",
